    "### Technical Knowledge includes;\n",
    "#### - Empirical analysis to assess the relative efficiency of the factors models (FF3, C4, and FF5 models). The primary goal is to determine which model provides the most complete explanation of the cross-section of stock returns specifically by minimizing the residual pricing error, known as alpha - α \n",
    "#### - Selected assets were from two different markets - UK & USA. These selected assets were based off on four distinct category; \n",
    "##### -     Agreesive Growth,   \n",
    "##### -     Deep Value,  \n",
    "##### -     High Quality/ Robust Profitability,   \n",
    "##### -     Mid-Cap/High Momentum   \n",
   ]
